<title>UK: Australian/N.Z. wool prices for April 1997.</title>
<headline>Australian/N.Z. wool prices for April 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commonwealth Secretariat estimated Australian and New Zealand wool prices for April as follows, in pence per kilo clean, cif UK dry-combed.</p>
<p>   70s 473	  64s 391	  60s 303	  58s 282</p>
<p>   56s 267	  50s 235	  48s 213	  46s 183</p>
<p>Prices are based on quotations from sales in Australia and New Zealand and represent unweighted average for super, good and average fleeces and skirting (free and light burry). Quotes for 56s and coarser are confined to New Zealand wools.</p>
</text>
